  "scope": "Unchanged WeightBasedTable/WeightedItem/NPCDropTable/DropTableParser/RareDropTable, the six shared weighted-chance tables, NPCDropTables, DropFrequency and RandomFunction on JDK 11. The complete pinned drop_tables.json and shared_tables/*.xml, designed parser, table, hand-off and boundary-draw cases. Each case seeds RandomFunction.RANDOM, the generator private to Collections.shuffle(List) and the thread's ThreadLocalRandom (the last two through reflection) and records how far each advanced per action. The rare table's guaranteed list is filled by its own add, reached through reflection on the private table. NPCDefinition lookup, clue registration, ring-of-wealth and glove queries, glove charges, the NPC behaviour callback, inventory space, item names and logging are recording adapters; Item keeps its constructor arguments. getClue, exceptionToString and the Log enum are original text inserted at generation time. Log text after the first line (JVM stack frames) is dropped. createDrop, loot share, bone crusher, drop messages, ground items and NPC death are not exercised.",
